kind: finding
is: Something must run the compiler first. The reading weighs three stored forms: source read by a C reader and slow evaluator; a machine-code image per target; or canonical numeric cells with a C evaluator and no C parser. For the third it estimates 1,400 to 1,600 lines of C; a reader for a small notation adds about 250; image-only needs 800 to 900.
