kind: finding
is: The reading's C line budget for a bootstrap over numeric cells: entry and thread 40; page allocation 30; six host calls 80; dlopen with one call trampoline 80; word and cell store 300; thaw and freeze 150; evaluator with about 25 primitives 600 to 800; bump allocator 60; fault handler 60. Parser, collector, emitters and caches go to the language.
