n: 3.6.9
name: drop
kind: hub
is: Six things the reading would leave behind: the closure as the unit of caching, with text as the joint between stages; machine-code emitters in C as a second copy of meaning; eight copies of each primitive in a 256-tag space; a value word classified by magnitude under a moving collector; operating-system interfaces and unbounded growth in the bootstrap file; cache files beside sources with identities that changed on rebuild until the old body repaired that. The reading's list also names one translation unit with global state and the loss of a second independent reader.
