kind: finding
is: Drop the closure as the unit of compiling and caching, and text as the joint between stages. In the old body BML becomes Form text, then parsed nodes, then one image per closure, so one edit rebuilt a 38 MB image. The reading's replacement: machine code and cache entries addressed by content per recipe, and relocatable.
