is: Drop machine-code emitters written in C beside the evaluator. In fkwu they are a second copy of meaning, take functions before the in-language emitter is asked, and both recorded changes of meaning sit at their 1,024-call threshold. The reading wants the bootstrap evaluator as the only second implementation, checked against compiled code or retired.
